      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi Joshua\n\nThe above mentioned bug in charmlibs is fixed and already part of the package we are using.\n\nCan you check why upgrade from existing charm to the newly built one changes the CSR? The idea is not to get certificates regenerated by upgrade of the charms unless it changes. I understand it is required for charms that generate certs per unit level based on POD ip address, however the other use cases where certificates generated at application level should not be regenerated.\n\noctavia-k8s is one example where certs are generated at application level, Can you test this PR with upgrade use case for octavia loadbalancer https://canonical-openstack.readthedocs-hosted.com/en/latest/how-to/features/load-balancer/#enabling-the-amphora-provider",
